48-    <p>The usual version of this question is <em>how many hours does the business need from me?</em>
49-    It is the wrong question, and answering it well can leave you exactly where you started.</p>
50-
51:    <p><strong>A workload is what consumes your time. A bottleneck is what cannot move without
52-    you.</strong> They are different quantities, and either can be large while the other is small —
53-    so hours alone cannot diagnose dependence, and the whole of this part depends on not confusing
54-    them.</p>
--
