checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json-47-    "severity": "medium",
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json:48:    "quote": "but it ended with him doing every job, as he had for five years.",
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json-49-    "problem": "“Five years” is not in this chapter’s source or its claim rows, and “doing every job” is contradicted by the same post — which this chapter’s own claims.tsv already registers as containing a contracted UX designer, writers, and Upwork contractors.",
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json:50:    "evidence": "Grep of checks/claims.tsv for chapter 19: no “five years” / “5 years” row. The phrase is registered only under chapter 18 against galperin-2023-fire (“for the first 5 years of the company”). galperin-2023-covid, the source this chapter cites, says he “contracted a very talented UX designer,” “hired a person who used to write for us,” and “engaged customer service people through Upwork previously as contractors.” A further Move 2 sentence, “He had been buying that work by the hour for years,” is likewise unregistered; the source says only “previously.”",
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json:51:    "fix": "End 2020 with him still the remaining bottleneck, having already bought design, writing and support as tasks. Drop “every job” and “five years,” or quote the chapter-18 source and register it. Replace “for years” with “previously,” which is what he wrote."
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json-52-  },
checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json-53-  {
