checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/grok.json-57-    "problem": "The $19.5k figure is end-2020, six months before the June 2021 hire, and the same stretch includes “significant churn,” so it cannot be used as eighteen months of revenue recurring through the shutdown, nor as the revenue the hire was made on.",
