checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/codex.err:105:    "fix": "End 2020 with him still the remaining bottleneck, having already bought design, writing and support as tasks. Drop “every job” and “five years,” or quote the chapter-18 source and register it. Replace “for years” with “previously,” which is what he wrote."
