checks/reviews/19-the-first-hire/codex.err:136:    "evidence": "Source: “In 2022 we continued to grow as a company, ending the year with 8 employees and 4 contractors.” Claims.tsv registers that split and nothing about intent. The chapter’s own following sentence: “He does not say which work went which way.” “On purpose” is what makes the split evidence that “both forms are legitimate” rather than leftover contractors, a hiring lag, or people who would not take employment.",
